  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> For every point of Accrual you possess, your Constitution increases by 4 when determining when you die from negative hit points or Constitution drain. In addition, for every point of Accrual you possess, add your total Accrual points to your Hit Dice for the purpose of determining when you die from negative levels.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/accrual#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
